  "text_md": "![](<8160caa0f0e21fbd0ef674de8759df133ccf_pg12_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n# Instrument Specification\n\n![](<8160caa0f0e21fbd0ef674de8759df133ccf_pg12_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Specification</td>\n    <td>Design value</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Field-of-View (hexagon)</td>\n    <td>~4.8 degree2 (⌀>2.7°)</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Multiplex fiber positioner</td>\n    <td>~2400</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Medium Resolution Spectrographs (2x) # Fibres<br><br>Passband<br><br>Velocity accuracy</td>\n    <td>R~5000–7000 1600 fibres<br><br>390-930 nm<br><br>< 2 km/s</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>High Resolution Spectrograph (1x) # Fibres Passband<br><br>Velocity accuracy</td>\n    <td>R~20,000 800 fibres 392-437 & 515-572 & 605-675 nm<br><br>< 1 km/s</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td># of fibers in ⌀=2’ circle</td>\n    <td>>3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Fibre diameter</td>\n    <td>⌀=1.4 arcsec</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Area (first 5 year survey)</td>\n    <td>>2h x 16,000 deg2</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Number of science spectra (5 year)</td>\n    <td>~75 million of 20 min</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n4MOST | MOS in the Next Decade, La Palma, 2-6 March 2015 | Roelof de Jong 14\n\n![](<8160caa0f0e21fbd0ef674de8759df133ccf_pg12_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n",
